    implementation:'Chabahar should be judged through equipment delivery, vessel calls, cargo volumes, corridor time and reliable finance. Diplomatic significance is real but is not identical to commercial utilisation.', evidenceNote:'Contract details not reproduced in the official public record are not invented; the dossier states the publicly documented scope and external constraints.', sourceIds:['deep-chabahar']
