    implementation:'Credible assessment needs emissions inventories, generation—not only capacity—grid reliability, finance, land impacts and adaptation outcomes. Diplomatic leadership and domestic decarbonisation are related but distinct records.', evidenceNote:'Targets are described from India’s filed NDC and ISA framework; causal claims about energy prices or emissions require separate data.', sourceIds:['deep-paris-ndc','deep-isa-framework']
